  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "MCCS Youth Basketball Registration",
      "level": 2,
      "markdown": "Sept. 8 - Oct. 2\n\nSeason runs November-March. Space is limited.\n\nAges 6-12 years*\n\n**Cost:** $40 for the first child; $35 for each additional child in the same family. **Space is limited.**\n\n($45 after Oct. 2, space permitting)\n\n*Depending upon final registration numbers, practices and games may be held aboard Camp Lejeune and MCAS New River.\n\n**Important Registration & Program Information:**\n\n- Birth certificate required for first time applicants. Minimum and Maximum age requirements are based on child's age as of Jan. 1, 2027.\n- Valid ID required.\n- A $15 service fee will be charged for all refunds (per child) after the registration period. No refunds after the first game."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Coaches Needed",
      "level": 2,
      "markdown": "Helping to build young athletes is about so much more than sports. As a leader and role model, you have an opportunity to impact young lives as they improve their skills both on and off the court or field. If you're looking to make a difference, contact our Youth Sports office for more information."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Basketball",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "**Winter Season**\n\n**Divisions:**\n- Ages 6-7\n- Ages 8-9\n- Ages 10-12"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Baseball & Tee-Ball",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "**Spring Season (Mar. - Jun.)**\n\n**Divisions:**\n- Tee-Ball: Ages 5-6\n- Coach Pitch: Ages 7-9\n- Baseball: Ages 10-12"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Running",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "**Spring Season (Mar. - Jun.)**\n\n- Juniors: Ages 6-9\n- Seniors: Ages 10-13"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Soccer",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "**Fall Season (Aug - Oct)**\n\n**Divisions:**\n- Age 5 (5v5)\n- Ages 6 -7 (7v7)\n- Ages 8 -9 (7v7)\n- Ages 10-12 (7v7)"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Flag Football",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "**Fall Season (Aug - Oct)**\n\n**Divisions:**\n- Ages 6-9 (7v7)\n- Ages 10-12 (7v7)"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Cheerleading",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "**Fall Season (Aug - Oct)**\n\n**Divisions:**\n- Ages 6-9\n- Ages 10-12"
    }
